<title>USA: Alliance Gaming names new CEO, President.</title>
<headline>Alliance Gaming names new CEO, President.</headline>
<dateline>LAS VEGAS 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alliance Gaming Corp said Thursday it had named Morris Goldstein chief executive and president, effective immediately.</p>
<p>Prior to joining Alliance Gaming, Goldstein was chief executive of Thomson Technology Initiative, a unit of Thomson Corp, the company said.  </p>
<p>Steve Greathouse stepped down as chairman, president and chief executive of Alliance Gaming at the end of 1996.  The company named David Robbins chairman in February of this year.</p>
